<title>USA: Grant Geophysical shrs to be delisted.</title>
<headline>Grant Geophysical shrs to be delisted.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grant Geophysical Inc said on Thursday both its common stock and convertible preferred stock would be delisted from the Nasdaq Stock Market due to an inability to comply with certain listing requirements.</p>
<p>The delisting would be effective with the close of business on January 24, it said.</p>
<p>Beginning on or shortly after January 27, the company said its securities would trade on &quot;Pink Sheets&quot; published by the National Daily Quotation Service.</p>
</text>
